        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Deadline&#39;s Pandemonium Key reads:</p><blockquote><p>The first time an environment target enters play each turn, play the top card of the villian deck.</p></blockquote><p>does this apply when any given envirnomental target enters play or any given type of environmental target?&nbsp; For instance, if The Final Wasteland, if an Amphibious Chupacabra is turned over in two different turns, is that considered one or two targets and therefor two villian card plays?&nbsp;</p><p>The &quot;The first time&quot; phrasing is confusing me, but I read it as each one would trigger the villian card play.</p><p>Thanks,<br />Ben</p>",
