      {
        "id": 126893,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-12T03:02:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Each turn, hero, villain or environment, if an Environment card comes into play, play the top card of the Villain deck. &nbsp;If a second target comes into play that same turn, you don't play a card.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>the first time each turn is limiting the effect to only play 1 card per turn.</p><p>So when Chupacabra comes into play: &nbsp;play a card.</p><p>The next Environment turn when chupacabra #2 comes into play, play a card.</p><p>If Con's Bunker causes more than one target to enter play that turn, you only play 1 villain card.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:01:25.389Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
